IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ucta-exclusions`

-- Unfair Contract Terms Act 1977, ss 1(3), 2, 3, 4, 6, 7(3A), 11(5), 12, 26, 27 and First Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_unfair-contract-terms-act-1977.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

